      "id": 6136,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-06T16:37:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As GenCon creeps closer and closer, readying itself for a violent and exciting pounce before wandering away for another year, I thought we should check in to see who might be attending. After all, this <span class=\"bbcode-b\">is</span> the 1-year anniversary of Sentinels of the Multiverse! :o</p>\n<p>With the hopes of putting more faces to names, I was curious when folks are going to be around. I’m going to be at the &gt;G booth all day Thursday, Friday, and Saturday, with possible short wanders about the hall to see what else is going on. (Unfortunately, I can’t make it Sunday.)</p>\n<p>I’m planning on putting “Rabit on &gt;G” on both sides of my name badge; if you see that, you’ll know it’s me. (Feel free to run away, scream in fear, or whatever else seems like an appropriate response. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> )</p>\n<p>How about you? Are you going to be at GenCon? When will you be there?</p>\n<p>Looking forward to the opportunity to meet some (more) of you!  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:59.335Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
