      "raw": "As GenCon creeps closer and closer, readying itself for a violent and exciting pounce before wandering away for another year, I thought we should check in to see who might be attending. After all, this [b]is[/b] the 1-year anniversary of Sentinels of the Multiverse! :o\n\nWith the hopes of putting more faces to names, I was curious when folks are going to be around. I'm going to be at the >G booth all day Thursday, Friday, and Saturday, with possible short wanders about the hall to see what else is going on. (Unfortunately, I can't make it Sunday.)\n\nI'm planning on putting \"Rabit on >G\" on both sides of my name badge; if you see that, you'll know it's me. (Feel free to run away, scream in fear, or whatever else seems like an appropriate response. ;) )\n\nHow about you? Are you going to be at GenCon? When will you be there? \n\nLooking forward to the opportunity to meet some (more) of you!  :D",
